+# Corpus fetching
+
+## Rate limit actually encountered
+
+The repository records that fetching was rate-limited, but it does not preserve the
+observed limit's number of visits, window length, or cooldown after a breach. Those
+three values therefore cannot be recovered from this checkout and are unknown; no
+values are supplied here rather than inventing them.
+
+## Fetch hosts
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com` — the raw-file host explicitly recorded in
+  `manifest.tsv` as the source used to fetch the corpus files.
+
+No CDN or mirror host used by the corpus fetch is recorded in this checkout. In
+particular, the available manifest, corpus notes, unavailable-file list, and Git
+history provide no evidence for an additional host, so none is claimed here.
